<title>USA: Fannie Mae sets $330 mln REMIC 1997-M2.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae sets $330 mln REMIC 1997-M2.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fannie Mae said it issued $330 million of Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities via Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p>REMIC trust 1997-M2 is backed by Government National Mortgage Association multifamily project loans, Fannie Mae said.</p>
<p>The issue priced February 24 and has a settlement date of April 21, the agency said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
